isu,\" visiting it twice a year."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c40158"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"元気×2な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は穏和で誰とでも仲良くなれる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27306","sourceWorkId":"3001","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"元気な少女。精神的にやや幼く無防備。プチ淫乱。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネガティブな言い方をすれば、頭が悪く、何より物覚えが悪い。興味津々な出来事にぶつかると、追跡するクセがある。基本的に穏和で、誰とでも仲良くなれる性格。直感で相手の嘘が見抜ける。ついでに嗅覚が妙に鋭い。父親がジャーナリスト。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"43358"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/62/62e60b69cf2ec9dc8d22a5f893ad5129d820cdfc7c2f9f6f98cf949da05f364d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e07c8ad71186da2b85a37c6da1350966642671e05b97fa9f94d48e60f4138f07.webp","width":239,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中田順子","creatorId":"vndb:s631","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s631","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s631","name":"中田 順子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:212672:43358:4463:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c51181","characterName":"雪野 ちとせ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"13313","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"212672"},{"characterId":"13313","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"271211"}],"egsCharacterIds":["4738"],"vndbCharacterId":"c51181"},"originalCharacterName":"雪野 ちとせ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"28"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The main heroine of the story. She steps in as the young proprietress of the Kinhou-rou, the hot spring inn that the protagonist visits."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to the original proprietress eloping with a younger man for the seventh time, Chitose, who happened to be on winter break, is called in to fill the role. Currently a student preparing for her entrance exams, she is under considerable stress, balancing her duties as an innkeeper with her studies, as the exams are less than a month away. Despite her youth, her directions as the proprietress are precise, earning her the respect and fondness of most of the inn's employees. She tends to be stubborn and obstinate when corrected by others, yet she does not resist changing her own opinions. She is somewhat egotistical and determined to thwart the protagonist's lecherous misdeeds at every turn."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c51181"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作のメインヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の訪れる温泉の若女将。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"宿の従業員からも、好意的に受け止められている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のスケベな悪事をことごとく邪魔しようとする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4738","sourceWorkId":"3375","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"温泉旅館・金峰館の若女将。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しっかりものだが根はお人好し。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"※「秘湯めぐり～欲情蹂躙温泉記」に登場"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4738","sourceWorkId":"7682","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【一般宿泊客】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"薫の代理人として主人公へ定期的に接触してくる謎の女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"柳条組のフロント企業・金峰ファイナンスの女社長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"途中からは宿泊客として桂城荘へやってくる。今年で28歳。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4738","sourceWorkId":"17832","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作のメインヒロイン。主人公の訪れる温泉宿・金峰楼（キンホウロウ）の若女将。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来の女将が若い男と７回目の蒸発をしてしまったため、たまたま冬休みだった彼女が呼ばれた。現在、受験生。試験まであと１ヶ月ないため、女将の仕事と受験勉強とで、かなりピリピリきている。若いながら、女将としての指図は的確で、宿の従業員からも、一部を除いてかなり好意的に受け止められている。人かのら注意には、頑固で意固地な性格を発揮するが、自分から意見を変えることにはあまり抵抗がない。唯我独尊タイプ。主人公のスケベな悪事をことごとく邪魔しようとする。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"13313"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4738","sourceWorkId":"3375","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"161 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4738","sourceWorkId":"3375","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4738","sourceWorkId":"3375","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4738","sourceWorkId":"3375","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/106a9f2a72af7e964d1846a7fa2715625d0bf4f0197fa4d642593495754f9310.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/57/57f43e2a1380c4bed1ed0775ba87e6bc7c9f6eac57f7b803c8c5f6d23dd4d45b.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西沢広香","creatorId":"vndb:s609","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s609","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s609","name":"西沢 広香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:212672:13313:5890:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c135647","characterName":"天露美紀男","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c135647"},"originalCharacterName":"天露美紀男","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lacking any particular dreams or ideals, he lives his life in a vague, unfocused manner, believing that if he just keeps his mouth open to the sky, luck will eventually fall into it, leading him to happiness. Physically, he's average in build, neither particularly muscular nor slender. His hobby is indulging in erotic fantasies, with a special fondness for mixed-gender bathing at hot springs."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c135647"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c3653","characterName":"安兼 実","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c3653"},"originalCharacterName":"安兼 実","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"47"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A maid at the inn, speaking in a Kansai dialect, she has only been working part-time as a maid for a week. Despite her short-tempered and assertive nature, she is deeply compassionate and possesses a chivalrous spirit. She is strict about peeping; attempting to take a photo could result in being hit with a tripod. Her catchphrase is, \"Photography is like capturing the soul. Just like with archery, the ideal is to have captured the shot before it's even taken. That's the true path of photography!\" She considers herself to be the seventh most beautiful woman in Japan. Her favorite hot spring is \"Hakone's Yumoto\". She prefers granular over solid bath additives, as they dissolve faster and mix better."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3653"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"u